Contract: "Start here · Preserve selected location and copy\nRoughly 1500-byte file and constrained app\nBoth controls · prompt-free reads · bounded acknowledgment" {class: start}
Relative: "Public parent-relative lookup\nopenat / fstatat / readlinkat\nLiteral, link, dot and trailing semantics still need proof"
