Receipt: "Unmeasured · callback and live executable identity\nproc_pidpath: 4096-byte public maximum\nWhole-path revalidation remains a consumer"
Decision: "Selected · one bounded native prototype\nThen return to supported-route design\nNo complete route or native pass adopted"
Limits: "Bounded investigation preserves\nPublic APIs · existing signing/consent posture\nNo shortening / another copy / workflow loss"
